hai faza o mein imam e asr ki zaqmi sada,<br>
sabera masooma zehra syeda ya tahera.<br>
fatima zehra fatima zehra .<br>
<br>
1.meri dadi tujpa sub ho shaam thi kaisi jafa<br>
tera girya teri bechaini wo baad e mustafa<br>
woh masayab ka ta sa sul aur woh tera housla.<br>
<br>
2.kaise kaise dard ke manzar nigaho mein rahe<br>
kaun jane tune kitne karb ek dil par sahe<br>
tu ne qurban deen par apna bhara ghar kar diya.<br>
<br>
3.sirf aathara baras ke sin mein aye bintay rasool<br>
doh qadam chalna bhi tujko hogaya mushkil batool<br>
hogaya pehlu shikasta haat mein aaya aasa.<br>
<br>
4.chadar e tatheer ki markaz woh bintay mustafa<br>
jisko khaliq ke nabi ne baz a tum minni kaha<br>
zulm ne uska kalega tukde tukde kar diya.<br>
<br>
5.ek bete ka kaleja zehr se tukdeh hua<br>
dasht mein pamal ek bete ka lasha ho gaya<br>
betiya dono hui balway mein haiii berida.<br>
<br>
6. ye sitam sareh agar roshan dino par toot tay<br>
woh nazar aatay sabhi tareekh mein dubey hue<br>
aaj bhi rota hu mein sunkar woh tera marsiya.<br>
<br>
7.ho gai duniya se ruksath jis ghadi bintay nabi<br>
sar se aam mama utara aur bohut roe ali<br>
aur yahi thay bain lab par ab mein tanha hogaya.<br>
<br>
8.de rahe thay gusl moula fatima ko jis ghadi<br>
jane kya guzri dil e muztar pe kyu tadpe ali<br>
sabir o shahkir ali ne kis liye sehaa kiya.<br>
<br>
9.baad marne ke bhi bibi kya sitam tuj par hue<br>
qabr mein bhi shah zadi reh na pai chain se<br>
zalima ne dha diya rouza tera ya fatima.<br>
<br>
10.dukthar e bintay nabi hoti rahi paiham shaheed<br>
dein imam e waqt ko ab milke ham pursa rasheed<br>
dein imam e waqt ko pursa tadap kar dein sada.